 "notes": "Read the full GA DOR plate list (PlateSelection.aspx, 339 links incl. motorcycle) in the browser. Every plate image is at mvd.dor.ga.gov/motor/plates/images/2004/<PlateCode>_Large.jpg (the folder is always '2004'; codes come from PlateDetails.aspx?PlateCode=XX links). Selfless Service is listed as 'Georgia Veterans Plate' (code VT), and I confirmed it by viewing the image. Alabama State, Shepherd Center and Southern University are HB 208 plates now in the catalog. Samford and the National Guard/Reserve 'Retired' variants may be older plates the 2023 snapshot missed, so their years are unknown. Every game plate matched a catalog entry, so there are no retirements; the '-no longer available' plates are already flagged in the game. Skipped: Ambulance, Hearse, Limousine, Taxi, Trailer, Low Speed Vehicle, MPOHV, Retired Legislators, and the Standard/Standard Alternate/America 250 standard plates."
